>Hello from this Hopspot

You have reached a Personal Hopspot: a small Prns node relaying Reticulum traffic for everyone around it. If you can read this, the mesh is working.

>What is Prns?

Prns is high-performance Reticulum (RNS), built for the performance, stability, and energy efficiency every Reticulum node needs. One engine and one API, the same on embedded,
desktop, mobile, games, and the web.

`F999"Reticulum is the foundational communication infrastructure of a
bright future we can have, as long as we all build it."`f

This node is one small piece of that future.

>Learn more

With internet access, visit either https://prns.dev or https://reticulum.rs to learn more. A future update is planned to host full docs & source over Nomad Network as well.

